#: ../developer/deployment.md:1
msgid "Deployment Guide"
msgstr "部署指南"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:3
msgid ""
"This page covers running HybridInference as a long-lived deployment: "
"reaching it, operating and releasing it, the first administrator, alerts,"
" and recovery. It assumes the stack already starts; first-time setup is "
"in [Installation](installation.md#running-with-docker)."
msgstr ""
"本页讲怎样把 HybridInference "
"作为长期运行的部署来维护：访问方式、日常运维与发布、第一个管理员、告警和故障恢复。本页假定服务栈已经能启动；首次搭建见[安装](installation.md"
"#running-with-docker)。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:8
