#: ../developer/deployment.md:18
msgid ""
"All three ports are published on loopback by default. The containers "
"share the `hybridinference` network, where the backend reaches the "
"database as `postgres:5432`. Under Compose, `DB_PORT` in `.env` sets only"
" the host side of the database's port, and `DB_HOST` is ignored (it "
"matters only for a backend started from source). The optional `pgadmin` "
"service starts only with the `admin` profile; see [pgAdmin](database.md"
"#optional-pgadmin)."
msgstr ""
"三个端口默认都只发布在回环地址上。容器共用 `hybridinference` 网络，后端在其中以 `postgres:5432` 访问数据库。在"
" Compose 下，`.env` 中的 `DB_PORT` 只决定数据库端口的主机端，`DB_HOST` "
"会被忽略（它只对从源码启动的后端有意义）。可选的 `pgadmin` 服务只在启用 `admin` profile 时启动；见 "
"[pgAdmin](database.md#optional-pgadmin)。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:25
msgid "Keeping it private: an SSH tunnel"
msgstr "不对外暴露：SSH 隧道"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:27
msgid ""
"A staging or scratch instance can keep the loopback defaults. Forward "
"both ports from your workstation:"
msgstr "staging 或临时实例可以保留回环地址的默认设置。从你的工作站转发两个端口："

#: ../developer/deployment.md:34
msgid ""
"Then open `http://localhost:3001`. Keep the local end on `localhost` or "
"`127.0.0.1`: the refresh cookie is `Secure` by default (`COOKIE_SECURE`),"
" and browsers accept a `Secure` cookie only over HTTPS or from a loopback"
" origin. Port 8080 is forwarded because the console calls the API at the "
"`NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE` built into its image, `http://localhost:8080` by "
"default; changing it needs a frontend rebuild."
msgstr ""
"然后打开 `http://localhost:3001`。本地这一端要用 `localhost` 或 `127.0.0.1`：刷新 cookie "
"默认带 `Secure` 标志（`COOKIE_SECURE`），而浏览器只在 HTTPS 或回环源上接受 `Secure` "
"cookie。之所以也转发 8080 端口，是因为控制台调用的是构建进镜像的 `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE`，默认为 "
"`http://localhost:8080`；修改它需要重新构建前端。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:41
msgid "Check that the stack answers:"
msgstr "检查服务栈是否应答："

#: ../developer/deployment.md:48
msgid ""
"The default `CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS` covers ports 3000, 3001 and 3002 on "
"`localhost` and `127.0.0.1`, and HTTPS on port 8443, so a tunnel needs no"
" CORS change."
msgstr ""
"默认的 `CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS` 已包含 `localhost` 和 `127.0.0.1` 上的 "
"3000、3001、3002 端口以及 8443 端口上的 HTTPS，所以使用隧道无需修改 CORS。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:52
msgid "Putting it on the public internet"
msgstr "把它放到公网上"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:54
msgid ""
"Nothing in the stack terminates TLS, and this repository ships no "
"reverse-proxy configuration. A proxy on the host uses `127.0.0.1:3001` "
"for the console or `127.0.0.1:8080` for direct gateway access; a proxy "
"container on the same Docker network uses `frontend:3001` or "
"`backend:8080`."
msgstr ""
"服务栈中没有任何组件终止 TLS，本仓库也不提供反向代理配置。主机上的代理用 `127.0.0.1:3001` 访问控制台，或用 "
"`127.0.0.1:8080` 直接访问网关；同一 Docker 网络中的代理容器用 `frontend:3001` 或 "
"`backend:8080`。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:59
msgid ""
"For a proxy on another machine, set `FRONTEND_HOST` in `.env` to an "
"interface it can reach (`0.0.0.0` for all IPv4 interfaces), restrict "
"access to that proxy, and run `make up`. The console also forwards the "
"API, so exposing its port exposes the API. Set `BACKEND_HOST` only if you"
" need direct gateway access. Releases before the loopback default bound "
"the console to `0.0.0.0`; if you relied on that, set `FRONTEND_HOST` "
"before upgrading."
msgstr ""
"如果代理在另一台机器上，在 `.env` 中把 `FRONTEND_HOST` 设为它能访问到的网卡地址（`0.0.0.0` 表示所有 IPv4 "
"网卡），只允许该代理访问，然后运行 `make up`。控制台也会转发 API，所以暴露它的端口就等于暴露了 API。只有需要直接访问网关时才设置"
" `BACKEND_HOST`。在默认绑定回环地址之前的版本把控制台绑定在 `0.0.0.0`；如果你依赖这一点，请在升级前设置 "
"`FRONTEND_HOST`。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:66
msgid ""
"Which paths the console serves and which it forwards is set by `deploy"
"/public-paths.json` and `next.config.js`, not by the proxy; see [The "
"public path table](public-path-table.md)."
msgstr ""
"哪些路径由控制台自己提供、哪些转发给后端，由 `deploy/public-paths.json` 和 `next.config.js` "
"决定，与代理无关；见[公开路径表](public-path-table.md)。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:70
msgid "What your proxy still has to do"
msgstr "代理仍然要负责的事"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:72
msgid ""
"Nothing inside the stack provides these. Without a proxy (a tunnel daemon"
" connecting straight to `127.0.0.1:3001`, say) you have none of them, and"
" nothing warns you:"
msgstr "服务栈内部不提供以下保护。不用代理（比如让隧道守护进程直连 `127.0.0.1:3001`）就一项也没有，而且没有任何警告："

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "Protection"
msgstr "防护项"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "What a proxy in front typically does"
msgstr "前置代理通常做什么"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "Next.js Server Action guard"
msgstr "Next.js Server Action 防护"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Refuse requests carrying a `Next-Action` header (`if ($http_next_action) "
"{ return 403; }`), so nobody outside the console can invoke its server "
"actions"
msgstr ""
"拒绝带 `Next-Action` 请求头的请求（`if ($http_next_action) { return 403; "
"}`），让控制台之外的任何人都无法调用它的 server action"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "Request body cap on `/v1/`"
msgstr "`/v1/` 的请求体大小上限"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid ""
"Bound request bodies (commonly `client_max_body_size 50m`). The gateway "
"itself refuses bodies over `REQUEST_MAX_BODY_MB` (32 MiB)"
msgstr ""
"限制请求体大小（常见的是 `client_max_body_size 50m`）。网关自己会拒绝超过 "
"`REQUEST_MAX_BODY_MB`（32 MiB）的请求体"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "`X-Forwarded-For` rewriting"
msgstr "`X-Forwarded-For` 重写"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid ""
"Overwrite a client-supplied chain, so only hops the proxy added reach the"
" gateway"
msgstr "覆盖客户端提供的链条，只让代理自己添加的跳到达网关"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:82
msgid ""
"The gateway reads forwarded headers only from proxies you authorize, but "
"never rewrites them; see [Trusted proxies and client IPs](trusted-"
"proxies-and-client-ips.md)."
msgstr ""
"网关只读取你授权的代理发来的转发请求头，但从不改写它们；见[可信代理与客户端 IP](trusted-proxies-and-client-"
"ips.md)。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:85
msgid "Splitting inference traffic at the entry"
msgstr "在入口分流推理流量"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:87
msgid ""
"By default every request goes through the console, so a release or "
"restart of the console interrupts long streams just as a gateway release "
"does. An entry that routes by path (an Ingress rule, a tunnel's path "
"routing, a load balancer) can instead send the paths the public path "
"manifest marks `entry_split`, `/v1` and `/anthropic`, straight to the "
"gateway, and everything else to the console."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下所有请求都经过控制台，所以控制台的发布或重启会像网关发布一样打断长流式请求。能按路径路由的入口（Ingress "
"规则、隧道的路径路由、负载均衡器）可以改为把公开路径清单中标为 `entry_split` 的路径（`/v1` 和 "
"`/anthropic`）直接发给网关，其余照旧发给控制台。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:93
msgid ""
"This is optional, and this repository ships no entry configuration. The "
"console image still forwards both prefixes, so removing the entry's two "
"rules rolls the split back, provided the gateway still trusts the console"
" and the console's stop grace period is unchanged. A gateway release "
"still gives open requests 5 seconds after the stop signal."
msgstr ""
"这是可选的，本仓库不提供入口配置。控制台镜像仍会转发这两个前缀，所以删掉入口上的两条规则就能撤销分流，前提是网关仍信任控制台、控制台的停止宽限期没有缩短。网关发布时，停止信号之后仍给进行中的请求"
" 5 秒。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:99
msgid "On the split paths, the entry must meet these conditions:"
msgstr "在分流的路径上，入口必须满足以下条件："

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "#"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "Condition"
msgstr "条件"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "E1"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/deployment.md
#, python-format
msgid ""
"It sends to the gateway only a path equal to `/v1` or `/anthropic`, or "
"starting with `/v1/` or `/anthropic/`, matched after resolving `.` and "
"`..` segments and percent-encoding (`/v1/%2e%2e/openapi.json` is not "
"under `/v1`)"
msgstr ""
"只把等于 `/v1` 或 `/anthropic`、或以 `/v1/` 或 `/anthropic/` 开头的路径发给网关，并且先解析 `.` 和"
" `..` 段与百分号编码再匹配（`/v1/%2e%2e/openapi.json` 不在 `/v1` 之下）"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "E2"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid ""
"It does not buffer responses, and does not read a whole request body "
"before forwarding it"
msgstr "不缓冲响应，也不把请求体整份读完再转发"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "E3"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid ""
"Its idle timeout is longer than the gateway's `REQUEST_TIMEOUT_SECONDS`, "
"and any limit on a request's total duration is no shorter than "
"`STREAM_REQUEST_TIMEOUT_SECONDS`. Streams send a keepalive every 15 "
"seconds"
msgstr ""
"它的空闲超时长于网关的 `REQUEST_TIMEOUT_SECONDS`，对请求总时长的任何限制都不短于 "
"`STREAM_REQUEST_TIMEOUT_SECONDS`。流式响应每 15 秒发送一次 keepalive"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "E4"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid ""
"Its request body limit is no lower than the gateway's own, including file"
" uploads under `/v1`"
msgstr "它的请求体大小限制不低于网关自己的限制，包括 `/v1` 下的文件上传"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "E5"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "When the client disconnects, it closes the request to the gateway"
msgstr "客户端断开时，关闭到网关的请求"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "E6"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid ""
"It overwrites the forwarding header the client sent (`X-Forwarded-For` or"
" `CF-Connecting-IP`)"
msgstr "覆盖客户端送来的转发头（`X-Forwarded-For` 或 `CF-Connecting-IP`）"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "E7"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "Only the entry and the console can reach the gateway's port"
msgstr "只有入口和控制台能访问网关的端口"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "E8"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid ""
"It does not resend a `POST` once it has reached the gateway; retrying "
"when the connection could not be established is fine"
msgstr "请求一旦到达网关就不再重发 `POST`；连接没能建立时重试没有问题"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "E9"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid ""
"Taking an instance out of rotation stops new requests but keeps open "
"connections; see [Handing traffic to a new gateway process](#handing-"
"traffic-to-a-new-gateway-process)"
msgstr ""
"把实例移出轮换时，停止发送新请求，但保留已打开的连接；见[把流量交给新的网关进程](#handing-traffic-to-a-new-"
"gateway-process)"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:113
msgid ""
"Clients see the gateway's own answers, with two differences: the `X"
"-Frame-Options` and `Referrer-Policy` page headers are not sent (the "
"gateway adds `X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff` itself), and when the "
"gateway is down the `502`, `503` or `504` carries the entry's body, not "
"the console's OpenAI-shaped JSON. To see which way a request went, "
"compare the gateway's request log, whose `peer_ip` names the process that"
" connected, with the entry's access log."
msgstr ""
"客户端看到的是网关自己的应答，有两处不同：不再发送 `X-Frame-Options` 和 `Referrer-Policy` "
"这两个页面请求头（`X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff` 由网关自己添加）；网关不可用时，`502`、`503` 或 "
"`504` 带的是入口的响应体，而不是控制台的 OpenAI 格式 JSON。要知道请求走的是哪条路，把网关请求日志中的 "
"`peer_ip`（它是发起连接的进程）与入口的访问日志对照。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:121
msgid "Client addresses with the entry in front"
msgstr "入口在前面时的客户端地址"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:123
msgid ""
"Requests through the entry must resolve to the same client addresses as "
"before, with the console stopped. Do not get there by trusting more: keep"
" `TRUST_PROXY_HEADERS` on, add no network that holds other workloads to a"
" trust list, and do not treat an `unknown` address as normal."
msgstr ""
"经过入口的请求必须解析出与以前相同的客户端地址，而且在控制台停止时也是如此。不要靠扩大信任来做到这一点：保持 "
"`TRUST_PROXY_HEADERS` 开启，不要把运行其他工作负载的网络加入信任列表，也不要把 `unknown` 地址当成正常结果。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:128
msgid ""
"With static trust, add the entry's exact peer address, as the gateway "
"sees it, to `TRUSTED_PROXIES` for an entry that writes `X-Forwarded-For`,"
" or to `TRUSTED_CLOUDFLARE_NETWORKS` for Cloudflare, and keep the "
"console's own entry. If the gateway cannot tell the entry's connections "
"from other processes' (behind a loopback port mapping every process on "
"the host shares one address), solve that first."
msgstr ""
"使用静态信任时，把网关看到的入口确切对端地址加入设置：入口写 `X-Forwarded-For` 时加入 "
"`TRUSTED_PROXIES`，Cloudflare 则加入 "
"`TRUSTED_CLOUDFLARE_NETWORKS`，同时保留控制台原有的条目。如果网关无法把入口的连接与其他进程的连接区分开（在回环端口映射之后，主机上的所有进程共用一个地址），先解决这个问题。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:135
msgid ""
"Kubernetes proxy discovery does not support the split: an entry outside "
"the discovered Service resolves to `unknown`, and with the frontend "
"stopped the discovered set is empty and `/health/ready` answers `503 "
"proxy_discovery_unavailable`. A deployment that uses discovery keeps the "
"console's forwarding."
msgstr ""
"Kubernetes 代理发现不支持分流：位于被发现 Service 之外的入口会解析为 "
"`unknown`，而前端停止时被发现的集合为空，`/health/ready` 会返回 `503 "
"proxy_discovery_unavailable`。使用代理发现的部署继续让控制台转发。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:141
msgid "Checking an entry split with the probe"
msgstr "用探针检查入口分流"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:143
#, python-format
msgid ""
"`ops/dev/entry_split_probe.py` tests the inference path from outside, "
"through the address clients use, on either topology. It never retries, so"
" every failed request counts. It runs long streams on "
"`/v1/chat/completions`, `/v1/responses` and `/anthropic/v1/messages`, "
"checking each frame's timing, the end marker and the usage report; short "
"requests on the same paths at a fixed rate; and boundary checks from "
"`deploy/public-paths.json` (split prefixes reach the gateway, unpublished"
" paths such as `/docs` and `/v1/%2e%2e/openapi.json` do not answer, a "
"missing key gets `401`)."
msgstr ""
"`ops/dev/entry_split_probe.py` "
"从外部、通过客户端使用的地址测试推理链路，两种拓扑都适用。它从不重试，所以每个失败的请求都会计数。它在 "
"`/v1/chat/completions`、`/v1/responses` 和 `/anthropic/v1/messages` "
"上运行长流式请求，检查每一帧的时间、结束标记和用量报告；以固定速率在相同路径上发送短请求；并按 `deploy/public-"
"paths.json` 做边界检查（分流前缀能到达网关，`/docs`、`/v1/%2e%2e/openapi.json` "
"等未公开路径不应答，缺少 key 时返回 `401`）。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:152
msgid ""
"Point the long streams at a synthetic upstream: the example's fake "
"provider (`distributions/example/fixtures/fake-openai-"
"provider/server.py`) started with `--stream-frames 600 --frame-interval-"
"ms 100` sends 600 numbered frames 100 ms apart, and an entry that buffers"
" shows up as frames arriving in bursts:"
msgstr ""
"让长流式请求指向一个合成上游：示例中的假 provider（`distributions/example/fixtures/fake-"
"openai-provider/server.py`）以 `--stream-frames 600 --frame-interval-ms "
"100` 启动时，会每隔 100 ms 发送一帧、共 600 个编号帧；会缓冲的入口表现为帧成批到达："

#: ../developer/deployment.md:163
msgid ""
"The key comes from the variable `--api-key-env` names (`PROBE_API_KEY` by"
" default). The exit status is `0` only when nothing failed. Run it while "
"you release, restart or stop the console: with the split in place, "
"nothing may fail. Run against the gateway's own port, it reports `/docs` "
"as reachable; that is why E7 keeps the port private."
msgstr ""
"key 从 `--api-key-env` 指定的变量读取（默认 `PROBE_API_KEY`）。只有没有任何失败时退出码才是 "
"`0`。在发布、重启或停止控制台时运行它：分流到位后，不应有任何失败。直接对网关自己的端口运行时，它会报告 `/docs` 可以访问；这正是 E7"
" 要求该端口不对外的原因。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:169
msgid "Everyday operations"
msgstr "日常运维"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:171
msgid "Run these from the repository root:"
msgstr "在仓库根目录运行以下命令："

#: ../developer/deployment.md:186
msgid ""
"`make up` and `make build` create the external volume "
"`hybridinference_postgres_data` if it is missing, apply the schema "
"migrations with the backend image, and then start the services. `make "
"restart` migrates nothing."
msgstr ""
"`make up` 和 `make build` 会在外部卷 `hybridinference_postgres_data` "
"不存在时创建它，用后端镜像执行 schema 迁移，然后启动服务。`make restart` 不做任何迁移。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:191
msgid ""
"Name optional profiles on the command line, which outranks every env "
"file: `make up COMPOSE_PROFILES=admin` (a comma-separated list). To keep "
"host-local choices (profiles, `CLOUD_AGENT_NETWORK`, `PGADMIN_PUBLISH`) "
"across commands, copy `.ops.env.example` to `.ops.env` and uncomment what"
" this host needs."
msgstr ""
"在命令行上指定可选 profile，命令行的优先级高于所有 env 文件：`make up "
"COMPOSE_PROFILES=admin`（逗号分隔的列表）。要让本机的选择（profile、`CLOUD_AGENT_NETWORK`、`PGADMIN_PUBLISH`）对所有命令都生效，把"
" `.ops.env.example` 复制为 `.ops.env`，再取消注释本机需要的项。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:196
msgid "Diagnostics, deployment and recovery"
msgstr "诊断、部署与恢复"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:207
msgid ""
"Set `GATEWAY_API_KEY` for authenticated inference checks. `make smoke` "
"runs the distribution's own `smoke.py` when it ships one."
msgstr "为需要认证的推理检查设置 `GATEWAY_API_KEY`。如果发行版自带 `smoke.py`，`make smoke` 会运行它。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:210
msgid ""
"`make deploy` records the running artifacts, pulls the pinned images, "
"runs the migrations with the new backend image, imports the previous "
"release's file configuration when `LEGACY_MANIFEST` is set (see [Model "
"and routing documents in the database](configuration.md#model-and-"
"routing-documents-in-the-database)), then switches the services and runs "
"the acceptance smoke. Any failure after the switch, including an "
"interruption, restores the previous images and runs the acceptance on "
"them. `make rollback` starts the recorded previous images without running"
" their migrations."
msgstr ""
"`make deploy` 会记录正在运行的制品，拉取固定的镜像，用新的后端镜像执行迁移，在设置了 `LEGACY_MANIFEST` "
"时导入上一版本的文件配置（见[数据库中的模型与路由文档](configuration.md#model-and-routing-"
"documents-in-the-"
"database)），然后切换服务并运行验收冒烟测试。切换之后的任何失败（包括被中断）都会恢复旧镜像，并在旧镜像上再次运行验收。`make "
"rollback` 启动记录中的旧镜像，不运行它们的迁移。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:219
msgid ""
"The record lives in `.ops/<distribution>/` (`.ops/none/` without a "
"distribution, in a subdirectory named after `COMPOSE_PROJECT_NAME` when "
"the shell sets it): `images.env` pins the images, and `previous.json` and"
" `current.json` name the releases. A deploy writes them only once its "
"release is accepted. While `images.env` exists, `make up`, `make migrate`"
" and the other lifecycle commands start the pinned images, and `make "
"build` refuses; delete `images.env` to return to source builds."
msgstr ""
"记录保存在 `.ops/<distribution>/` 中（没有发行版时为 `.ops/none/`；shell 设置了 "
"`COMPOSE_PROJECT_NAME` 时还会再分一层以它命名的子目录）：`images.env` 固定镜像，`previous.json`"
" 和 `current.json` 记录版本。只有版本通过验收后，部署才会写入它们。只要 `images.env` 存在，`make "
"up`、`make migrate` 等生命周期命令就会启动固定的镜像，`make build` 会拒绝执行；删除 `images.env` "
"即可回到源码构建。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:227
msgid ""
"`make backup` writes to `.ops/<distribution>/gateway.dump` unless you set"
" `BACKUP`. The dump holds every stored secret, so keep it private and "
"copy it off the host. `make restore-check` is described under "
"[Backup](database.md#backup)."
msgstr ""
"不设置 `BACKUP` 时，`make backup` 写到 "
"`.ops/<distribution>/gateway.dump`。转储包含所有已存储的密钥，请妥善保管并复制到主机之外。`make "
"restore-check` 见[备份](database.md#backup)。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:231
msgid "Handing traffic to a new gateway process"
msgstr "把流量交给新的网关进程"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:233
msgid ""
"A release can start a new gateway process beside the old one and stop the"
" old one only when it has nothing left: no request cut short, no request-"
"log row or cost lost. The release asks the old process instead of waiting"
" a fixed time. Stopping with a signal is unchanged: open requests get "
"five seconds, then are cancelled."
msgstr "发布时可以在旧网关进程旁边启动新进程，等旧进程什么都不剩时再停止它：不打断任何请求，不丢失任何请求日志行或费用。发布流程会询问旧进程，而不是等待固定的时间。用信号停止的行为不变：进行中的请求有五秒时间，之后被取消。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:239
msgid ""
"The handoff routes exist only when the process has `HANDOFF_TOKEN` in its"
" environment, a random value of at least 32 characters; otherwise they "
"answer 404. They live under `/internal/handoff`, which no public path "
"list includes, so neither the console nor an entry forwards them. Call "
"each process at its own address with `Authorization: Bearer "
"<HANDOFF_TOKEN>`. This is not the administrator token, which is read-only"
" for changes wherever administrators need a second factor."
msgstr ""
"只有进程环境中有 `HANDOFF_TOKEN`（至少 32 个字符的随机值）时，交接路由才存在；否则它们返回 404。这些路由位于 "
"`/internal/handoff` 下，不在任何公开路径列表中，所以控制台和入口都不会转发它们。用 `Authorization: "
"Bearer <HANDOFF_TOKEN>` "
"在每个进程自己的地址上调用。这不是管理员令牌；在要求管理员第二重验证的部署中，管理员令牌对修改是只读的。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "Call"
msgstr "调用"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "What it does"
msgstr "作用"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "`GET /internal/handoff`"
msgstr "`GET /internal/handoff`"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid ""
"The state (`serving`, `draining` or `sealed`), the work under way, "
"`blocking` (why a seal would fail now) and `idle`"
msgstr "状态（`serving`、`draining` 或 `sealed`）、正在进行的工作、`blocking`（封口此刻会失败的原因）和 `idle`"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "`POST /internal/handoff/drain`"
msgstr "`POST /internal/handoff/drain`"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "Begins draining"
msgstr "开始排空"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "`POST /internal/handoff/seal`"
msgstr "`POST /internal/handoff/seal`"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid ""
"Seals if nothing is left (200); otherwise answers 409 with `blocking` and"
" keeps draining"
msgstr "没有剩余工作时封口（200）；否则返回 409 和 `blocking`，并继续排空"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "`POST /internal/handoff/resume`"
msgstr "`POST /internal/handoff/resume`"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "Serves normally again, from draining or sealed; this abandons a release"
msgstr "从排空或封口状态恢复正常服务；这会放弃本次发布"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:254
msgid "A release runs in this order:"
msgstr "发布按这个顺序进行："

#: ../developer/deployment.md:256
msgid ""
"Start the new process and accept it: `/health/ready` answers 200 and it "
"serves the acceptance requests."
msgstr "启动新进程并验收：`/health/ready` 返回 200，并且能处理验收请求。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:258
msgid "Take the old process out of the entry's rotation (E9)."
msgstr "把旧进程从入口的分配中摘掉（E9）。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:259
msgid "Drain the old process."
msgstr "让旧进程开始排空。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:260
msgid "Call seal until it answers 200. Polling never holds a drain open."
msgstr "反复调用 seal，直到返回 200。轮询从不会让排空无法结束。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:261
msgid "Stop the old process."
msgstr "停止旧进程。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:263
msgid ""
"If the seal does not succeed in the time you expect, do not stop the "
"process: keep it, record the release as unfinished, and read `blocking`. "
"The longest a request may run is `STREAM_REQUEST_TIMEOUT_SECONDS`, an "
"hour by default. To abandon the release, resume the old process and "
"remove the new one."
msgstr ""
"如果在预期时间内封口没有成功，不要停止进程：保留它，把发布记为未完成，并查看 `blocking`。请求最长可以运行 "
"`STREAM_REQUEST_TIMEOUT_SECONDS`，默认一小时。要放弃发布，恢复旧进程并移除新进程。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:268
msgid ""
"A draining process still serves every request that reaches it. Its "
"`/health/ready` answers 503 with `\"reason\": \"draining\"` (`/health` "
"stays 200), every response carries `Connection: close`, and idle "
"connections are closed after five seconds. It claims no new batch items "
"and runs no scheduled jobs; the other process does."
msgstr ""
"排空中的进程仍会处理到达它的每个请求。它的 `/health/ready` 返回 503 和 `\"reason\": "
"\"draining\"`（`/health` 仍返回 200），每个响应都带 `Connection: "
"close`，空闲连接在五秒后关闭。它不再领取新的批处理条目，也不运行定时任务；这些由另一个进程负责。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:274
msgid "`blocking` lists what is left:"
msgstr "`blocking` 列出还剩下什么："

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "`blocking`"
msgstr "`blocking`"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "What is left"
msgstr "还剩什么"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "`requests_in_flight`"
msgstr "`requests_in_flight`"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "A request in progress, streams included"
msgstr "一个进行中的请求，包括流式请求"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "`connections_open`"
msgstr "`connections_open`"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "An open client connection, other than the release's calls and probes"
msgstr "一个打开的客户端连接，发布调用和探活的连接除外"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "`background_writes`"
msgstr "`background_writes`"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid ""
"Work a request left behind, such as a cost increment or an alert being "
"sent"
msgstr "请求留下的工作，例如一次费用累加或一条正在发送的告警"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "`request_log_unwritten`"
msgstr "`request_log_unwritten`"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "Request-log rows queued or being written"
msgstr "排队或正在写入的请求日志行"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "`request_log_lost`"
msgstr "`request_log_lost`"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid ""
"A request-log row that was dropped or failed to write since the process "
"started. Never clears"
msgstr "进程启动以来有请求日志行被丢弃或写入失败。不会消除"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "`stream_close_abandoned`"
msgstr "`stream_close_abandoned`"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid ""
"A stream whose close took more than ten seconds and was cut short, so its"
" billing or logging may be incomplete. Never clears"
msgstr "某个流的关闭耗时超过十秒而被中断，它的计费或日志可能不完整。不会消除"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "`batch_work_running`"
msgstr "`batch_work_running`"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "A batch item, validation, sealing, delivery or sweep still running here"
msgstr "本进程中仍在运行的批处理条目、校验、封口、投递或清扫"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "`scheduled_jobs_running`"
msgstr "`scheduled_jobs_running`"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "A scheduled job, or a broadcast still sending"
msgstr "一个定时任务，或一封仍在发送的群发邮件"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "`spend_unwritten`"
msgstr "`spend_unwritten`"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid ""
"A cost not yet added to the counters, or, in the shared spend mode, a "
"reservation not yet settled"
msgstr "一笔尚未计入计数器的费用，或在共享花费模式下一笔尚未结算的预留"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "`spend_unconfirmed`"
msgstr "`spend_unconfirmed`"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid ""
"A cost that waiting will not confirm: one the counters refused, a write "
"with an unknown outcome, or, in the shared spend mode, a quarantined "
"reservation or refused increment. Never clears"
msgstr "一笔等待也无法确认的费用：被计数器拒绝的费用、结果未知的写入，或在共享花费模式下被隔离的预留或被拒绝的累加。不会消除"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:289
msgid ""
"The three reasons that never clear keep the process draining for as long "
"as it lives. Keep it, record what the status reports, and reconcile "
"before you stop it. There is no way to force a seal, and clearing the "
"records is not reconciling. An empty `blocking` also means every cost the"
" process recorded is confirmed in the counters (each ledger in `spend` "
"reports `confirmed`)."
msgstr ""
"这三个不会消除的原因会让进程在整个生命周期内一直处于排空状态。保留它，记下状态报告的内容，对账之后再停止它。没有办法强制封口，清除记录也不算对账。`blocking`"
" 为空还意味着该进程记录的每笔费用都已在计数器中确认（`spend` 中的每个账本都会报告 `confirmed`）。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:295
msgid ""
"Checking and switching to `sealed` is one step. After it, every request "
"is refused with 503 and the code `instance_sealed` before any upstream "
"call, and counted in `requests.refused_after_seal`; a release that saw "
"any did not hand over cleanly. At shutdown the process logs its state "
"(event `handoff_state_at_shutdown`)."
msgstr ""
"检查并切换到 `sealed` 是同一步。此后每个请求在任何上游调用之前就以 503 和代码 `instance_sealed` 被拒绝，并计入 "
"`requests.refused_after_seal`；出现过这种拒绝的发布不算干净交接。关闭时，进程会记录它所处的状态（事件 "
"`handoff_state_at_shutdown`）。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:301
msgid ""
"Run one uvicorn worker per instance: with several workers behind one "
"port, or under gunicorn, drain and seal answer 409. While two processes "
"run side by side, each enforces per-user concurrency, login rate limits "
"and auth blocks on its own, so a user can briefly have twice their "
"concurrent requests. Budgets are shared only in the shared spend mode, "
"which is switched on with every process stopped."
msgstr ""
"每个实例只运行一个 uvicorn worker：同一端口后面有多个 worker，或者运行在 gunicorn 下时，drain 和 seal "
"都返回 "
"409。两个进程并行运行时，各自独立执行按用户的并发限制、登录限流和认证封禁，所以一个用户可能短暂拥有两倍的并发请求。只有在共享花费模式下预算才是共享的，而该模式要在所有进程都停止时才能开启。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:308
msgid "What a change actually requires"
msgstr "改动之后到底要做什么"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "You changed"
msgstr "你改了什么"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "Do this"
msgstr "该怎么做"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "A setting in **Admin → Settings**"
msgstr "**Admin → Settings** 中的设置项"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid ""
"Nothing, unless it is marked **Restart required**: then select **Restart "
"backend**, or run `make restart s=backend`"
msgstr ""
"什么都不用做，除非它标有 **Restart required**：这时选择 **Restart backend**，或运行 `make "
"restart s=backend`"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid ""
"A value in `.env` that stays in the environment: the database connection,"
" ports, the configuration selectors a rollback needs, console values"
msgstr "`.env` 中留在环境变量里的值：数据库连接、端口、回滚所需的配置选择变量、控制台的值"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid ""
"`make up`. A container reads its `env_file` when it is created, so "
"`docker compose restart` keeps the old environment"
msgstr "`make up`。容器在创建时读取 `env_file`，所以 `docker compose restart` 会保留旧的环境"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "Any other value in `.env`"
msgstr "`.env` 里的其他值"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid ""
"Nothing happens once the database has the setting; change it in Admin. "
"See [Upgrading a deployment that kept its settings in "
"`.env`](#upgrading-a-deployment-that-kept-its-settings-in-env)"
msgstr ""
"数据库中已有该设置项后不会有任何效果；请在 Admin 中修改。见[升级把设置放在 `.env` 里的部署](#upgrading-a"
"-deployment-that-kept-its-settings-in-env)"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "The model catalog, routing policy or alert rules"
msgstr "模型目录、路由策略或告警规则"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "Follow the **Restart required** marker; no rebuild"
msgstr "按 **Restart required** 标记操作；无需重新构建"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "Site configuration or branding"
msgstr "站点配置或品牌"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "Applies when settings refresh; no rebuild or restart"
msgstr "设置刷新时应用；无需重新构建或重启"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "A file in the mounted site-assets directory"
msgstr "挂载的 site-assets 目录中的文件"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "Replace the file in the deployment overlay; no rebuild"
msgstr "替换部署 overlay 中的文件；无需重新构建"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "`AGENT_WEB_INTERNAL_URL` or `AGENT_CONTROL_PLANE_INTERNAL_URL`"
msgstr "`AGENT_WEB_INTERNAL_URL` 或 `AGENT_CONTROL_PLANE_INTERNAL_URL`"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "`make up`; the console reads them at runtime"
msgstr "`make up`；控制台在运行时读取它们"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "A build-time `NEXT_PUBLIC_*` value"
msgstr "构建时的 `NEXT_PUBLIC_*` 值"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "`make build s=frontend`; it is compiled into the browser bundle"
msgstr "`make build s=frontend`；它会被编译进浏览器包"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "Backend or frontend source"
msgstr "后端或前端的源码"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "`make build`, or `make build s=<service>`"
msgstr "`make build`，或 `make build s=<service>`"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:322
msgid ""
"The console reads its name and branding from the backend's `/site-config`"
" at runtime. The old `NEXT_PUBLIC_*` branding variables remain only as "
"build arguments for existing pipelines."
msgstr ""
"控制台在运行时从后端的 `/site-config` 读取名称和品牌。旧的 `NEXT_PUBLIC_*` "
"品牌变量只作为构建参数保留，供现有流水线使用。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:326
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:328
msgid ""
"`.env` holds the database connection and the container settings; every "
"other setting lives in the database and is edited in **Admin → "
"Settings**. See [Settings stored in the database](configuration.md"
"#settings-stored-in-the-database)."
msgstr ""
"`.env` 保存数据库连接和容器设置；其他所有设置项都在数据库中，在 **Admin → Settings** "
"中编辑。见[存储在数据库中的设置项](configuration.md#settings-stored-in-the-database)。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:332
msgid "Upgrading a deployment that kept its settings in `.env`"
msgstr "升级一个把设置项放在 `.env` 里的部署"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:334
msgid ""
"Nothing has to change before the upgrade. At its first start the new "
"backend copies into the database every setting that has a value in its "
"environment (from `.env`, an overlay's `deploy/*.env` and the Compose "
"passthroughs) and logs `Imported N setting(s) from the environment into "
"the database`. The existing `JWT_SECRET_KEY` and `API_KEY_SECRET` are "
"copied too, so sessions and API keys keep working, and a database that "
"has accounts never shows the setup page."
msgstr ""
"升级前什么都不用改。新后端首次启动时，会把环境中（来自 `.env`、overlay 的 `deploy/*.env` 以及 Compose "
"传入的值）每个有值的设置项复制到数据库，并记录 `Imported N setting(s) from the environment into "
"the database`。现有的 `JWT_SECRET_KEY` 和 `API_KEY_SECRET` 也会被复制，所以会话和 API key"
" 照常可用，已有账号的数据库也不会显示设置页面。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:341
msgid ""
"From then on the database value wins: editing the line in `.env` changes "
"nothing, and Admin marks the setting **Environment ignored**. Delete the "
"lines when convenient, but keep a copy of `.env` until a rollback is no "
"longer possible, because an earlier release reads its settings only from "
"the environment."
msgstr ""
"此后以数据库中的值为准：修改 `.env` 中的那一行不会有任何效果，Admin 会把该设置项标为 **Environment "
"ignored**。方便时删掉这些行，但在不再可能回滚之前保留一份 `.env`，因为旧版本只从环境变量读取设置。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:347
msgid "The log warns about the values it does not copy:"
msgstr "日志会对没有复制的值发出警告："

#: ../developer/deployment.md:349
msgid ""
"A value that conflicts with a stored setting, such as `TRUST_X_REAL_IP=1`"
" while the stored `TRUST_PROXY_HEADERS` is off; the stored value wins. "
"Check proxy trust after an upgrade: Compose passes `TRUST_PROXY_HEADERS` "
"with a default of `0`, so a database that stored that `0` ignores a `1` "
"in `.env`. See [Trusted Proxies and Client IPs](trusted-proxies-and-"
"client-ips.md)."
msgstr ""
"与已存储设置项冲突的值，例如已存储的 `TRUST_PROXY_HEADERS` 为关闭时的 "
"`TRUST_X_REAL_IP=1`；以存储的值为准。升级后请检查代理信任：Compose 传入的 `TRUST_PROXY_HEADERS` "
"默认是 `0`，数据库存下这个 `0` 后，就会忽略 `.env` 中的 `1`。见[可信代理与客户端 IP](trusted-proxies-"
"and-client-ips.md)。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:354
msgid ""
"`ERASURE_FENCE_SECRET`, once the erasure fence uses `API_KEY_SECRET`. "
"Remove the variable: while it is set, the backend refuses to start; see "
"[Database](database.md#secrets-for-deleting-accounts)."
msgstr ""
"`ERASURE_FENCE_SECRET`，在擦除栅栏改用 `API_KEY_SECRET` "
"之后。请删除这个变量：只要它还在，后端就拒绝启动；见[数据库](database.md#secrets-for-deleting-"
"accounts)。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:358
msgid ""
"The Compose passthroughs' built-in defaults are imported as well, so a "
"new deployment starts with the default `FRONTEND_URL`, "
"`CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS`, `SITE_NAME` and mail sender until you change "
"them."
msgstr ""
"Compose 传入项的内置默认值也会被导入，所以新部署一开始使用默认的 "
"`FRONTEND_URL`、`CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS`、`SITE_NAME` 和邮件发件人，直到你修改它们。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:362
msgid "Application configuration"
msgstr "应用配置"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:364
msgid ""
"Models, routing, alert rules, site identity and branding live in the "
"database. This release ignores the retired `*_CONFIG_PATH`, "
"`DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_PATH` and `DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_MODE` variables, and "
"warns at startup while one is set. Keep them, and the files they name, "
"through the rollback window: a rolled-back release reads its files "
"through them, and the legacy import uses them. See "
"[Configuration](configuration.md)."
msgstr ""
"模型、路由、告警规则、站点标识和品牌都存放在数据库中。本版本忽略已退役的 "
"`*_CONFIG_PATH`、`DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_PATH` 和 `DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_MODE` "
"变量，只要设置了其中之一，启动时就会发出警告。在回滚窗口内保留它们以及它们指向的文件：回滚后的版本通过它们读取文件，旧配置导入也会用到它们。见[配置](configuration.md)。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:371
msgid "Local inference servers"
msgstr "本地推理服务器"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:373
msgid ""
"The backend container reaches servers on the host at "
"`host.docker.internal` (mapped with `extra_hosts: host.docker.internal"
":host-gateway`). Write that address in the model's route; the gateway "
"never rewrites provider URLs:"
msgstr ""
"后端容器通过 `host.docker.internal` 访问主机上的服务（由 `extra_hosts: "
"host.docker.internal:host-gateway` 映射）。在模型的路由中写这个地址；网关从不改写 provider URL："

#: ../developer/deployment.md:388
msgid ""
"A backend running directly on the host uses `localhost`. See [Adding a "
"New Local Model](add-local-model.md)."
msgstr "直接在主机上运行的后端使用 `localhost`。见[添加新的本地模型](add-local-model.md)。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:391
msgid "Health checks"
msgstr "健康检查"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:393
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Anyone may call `/health` and `/health/ready`, and gets the status code "
"and `{\"status\": ...}`. An administrator's credential (a console token "
"or `ADMIN_TOKEN`) also shows the reason, the process's `instance`, the "
"route count and each store's state:"
msgstr ""
"任何人都可以调用 `/health` 和 `/health/ready`，得到状态码和 `{\"status\": "
"...}`。管理员凭据（控制台令牌或 `ADMIN_TOKEN`）还能看到原因、进程的 `instance`、路由数量和每个存储的状态："

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "Endpoint"
msgstr "端点"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "Answers 503 when"
msgstr "返回 503 的情况"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "`/health`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid ""
"Every configured store is down, or the configured database was "
"unreachable at startup (`database_unavailable_at_startup`). One store "
"down gives `\"status\": \"degraded\"` with 200, so the container "
"`HEALTHCHECK` does not kill a backend that still serves"
msgstr ""
"所有已配置的存储都不可用，或者已配置的数据库在启动时无法连接（`database_unavailable_at_startup`）。只有一个存储不可用时返回"
" 200 和 `\"status\": \"degraded\"`，这样容器的 `HEALTHCHECK` 不会杀掉仍在服务的后端"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "`/health/ready`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid ""
"Any configured store is down, the process is draining, or Kubernetes "
"proxy discovery has no fresh proxy set. Use it for readiness"
msgstr "任一已配置的存储不可用、进程正在排空，或 Kubernetes 代理发现没有新鲜的代理集合。用它做就绪检查"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "`/health/deep`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "Every configured store is down. It also reports each endpoint's health"
msgstr "所有已配置的存储都不可用。它还会报告每个端点的健康状况"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:422
msgid ""
"With `DB_ENABLED=false`, `database_configured` is `false` and the status "
"is `healthy`."
msgstr "`DB_ENABLED=false` 时，`database_configured` 为 `false`，状态为 `healthy`。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:425
msgid "Marking monitor traffic"
msgstr "给监控流量打标记"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:427
msgid ""
"Send `X-Probe: synthetic` on a monitor's inference requests to keep them "
"out of `api_logs`, the dashboards and RouteWise's learning. A marked "
"request also records no routing observation and gets an `X-Provider` "
"response header naming the backend that answered."
msgstr ""
"在监控程序的推理请求上发送 `X-Probe: synthetic`，让它们不进入 `api_logs`、仪表盘和 RouteWise "
"的学习。带标记的请求也不记录路由观测，并会收到一个 `X-Provider` 响应头，写明是哪个后端应答的。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:432
msgid ""
"The marker is honoured only from an authenticated API key with the "
"internal or admin role, never from a free or pro key, an agent grant, or "
"an anonymous caller on a gateway with `USER_AUTH_ENABLED=0`. It never "
"affects billing, and it does not protect a monitor from the auth-failure "
"blocklist (see [below](#a-monitor-or-service-account-is-suddenly-getting-"
"429s)). To log marked requests anyway, turn on the `log_synthetic_probes`"
" runtime setting."
msgstr ""
"只有来自 internal 或 admin 角色、经过认证的 API key 的标记才会被采纳；free 或 pro key、agent "
"授权，以及 `USER_AUTH_ENABLED=0` "
"网关上的匿名调用方发送的标记一律无效。它从不影响计费，也不能让监控程序免于认证失败封禁（见[下文](#a-monitor-or-service-"
"account-is-suddenly-getting-429s)）。如果仍想记录带标记的请求，开启运行时设置 "
"`log_synthetic_probes`。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:439
msgid "Alerting"
msgstr "告警"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:441
msgid ""
"The backend sends alerts to one Slack or WeCom (企业微信) group webhook. In "
"the **Alerts** section of **Admin → Settings → Alerts**, choose a "
"**Notification channel** and enter its webhook URL; saved URLs are write-"
"only. Choose **None** to turn notifications off."
msgstr ""
"后端把告警发送到一个 Slack 或企业微信群 webhook。在 **Admin → Settings → Alerts** 的 "
"**Alerts** 部分选择 **Notification channel** 并填写其 webhook URL；已保存的 URL "
"只能写入。选择 **None** 可以关闭通知。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "Setting"
msgstr "设置项"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "Value"
msgstr "取值"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "`ALERTS_ENABLED`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "Turns the in-process engine on; applies after a backend restart"
msgstr "开启进程内告警引擎；重启后端后生效"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "`SLACK_ALERTS_WEBHOOK_URL`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "Dedicated Slack webhook; falls back to `SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL` when empty"
msgstr "专用的 Slack webhook；为空时回退到 `SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL`"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "`SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL`"
msgstr "`SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL`"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "Slack fallback; also enables the failed-request detector"
msgstr "Slack 回退地址；同时启用失败请求检测器"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "`WECOM_ALERTS_WEBHOOK_URL`"
msgstr "`WECOM_ALERTS_WEBHOOK_URL`"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "WeCom group webhook; also enables the failed-request detector"
msgstr "企业微信群 webhook；同时启用失败请求检测器"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:453
msgid ""
"Slack and WeCom are mutually exclusive. Webhook changes apply after a "
"backend restart, or within about ten seconds once an operator activates "
"the `alerts.runtime` live group; see [Settings that apply without a "
"restart](configuration.md#settings-that-apply-without-a-restart). **Send "
"test notification** sends a marked test without saving anything. A URL "
"typed into the test field must be the platform's official HTTPS endpoint "
"(`hooks.slack.com`, `hooks.slack-gov.com` or `qyapi.weixin.qq.com/cgi-"
"bin/webhook/send`), so an admin session cannot make the server call an "
"arbitrary address. A saved HTTPS URL may point elsewhere, such as a "
"Slack-compatible Mattermost."
msgstr ""
"Slack 和企业微信只能二选一。webhook 的修改在重启后端后生效；运维人员激活 `alerts.runtime` "
"实时组后，大约十秒内生效；见[无需重启即可生效的设置项](configuration.md#settings-that-apply-"
"without-a-restart)。**Send test notification** "
"发送一条带标记的测试消息，不保存任何内容。在测试框中输入的 URL 必须是该平台的官方 HTTPS "
"端点（`hooks.slack.com`、`hooks.slack-gov.com` 或 `qyapi.weixin.qq.com/cgi-"
"bin/webhook/send`），这样管理员会话就不能让服务器访问任意地址。已保存的 HTTPS URL 可以指向别处，例如兼容 Slack "
"的 Mattermost。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:464
msgid ""
"Rules and thresholds are the `ALERT_RULES` document, under **Advanced** "
"in **Admin → Settings → Alerts** (empty means built-in thresholds; "
"changes need a restart). Two auth rules have deliberate defaults: "
"`rules.auth_failure_spike` is off, because bad keys are background noise,"
" and `rules.auth_ip_blocked` is on, because the source the blocklist "
"refuses is sometimes the deployment's own monitor."
msgstr ""
"规则和阈值是 `ALERT_RULES` 文档，位于 **Admin → Settings → Alerts** 的 **Advanced** "
"下（为空表示使用内置阈值；修改后需要重启）。两条认证规则的默认值是有意为之：`rules.auth_failure_spike` "
"默认关闭，因为错误的 key 是互联网背景噪声；`rules.auth_ip_blocked` "
"默认开启，因为被封禁的来源有时正是本部署自己的监控程序。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:471
msgid "What an auth alert tells you"
msgstr "认证告警里有什么"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:473
msgid ""
"An auth-failure card names the sources, how many distinct addresses, the "
"key prefixes presented, why each failed and the paths hit; the recovery "
"card summarizes the whole incident. **Known Accounts** names accounts "
"whose issued keys were refused, with `credential_state` (`revoked`, "
"`expired`, `user_suspended`): usually a stale monitor or CI credential. "
"The lookup is skipped under load or with "
"`AUTH_FAILURE_IDENTIFY_CALLER=false`, so no named account does not prove "
"the traffic is external. **Arrived Via Peers** appears when the addresses"
" came from forwarding headers, and names the sockets they arrived on. "
"Counts marked `(capped)` are lower bounds."
msgstr ""
"认证失败告警卡片会列出来源、不同地址的数量、所出示 key 的前缀、每次失败的原因以及被访问的路径；恢复卡片汇总整个事件。**Known "
"Accounts** 列出本部署签发的 key 被拒绝的账号，并附上 "
"`credential_state`（`revoked`、`expired`、`user_suspended`）：通常是过期的监控或 CI "
"凭据。负载高时或设置 `AUTH_FAILURE_IDENTIFY_CALLER=false` "
"时会跳过这项查询，所以没有列出账号并不能证明流量来自外部。**Arrived Via Peers** "
"在地址来自转发请求头时出现，并列出这些请求实际到达的套接字。标有 `(capped)` 的计数是下限。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:483
msgid "Silencing alerts from the dashboard"
msgstr "在仪表盘中静音告警"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:485
msgid ""
"**Admin → Settings → Alerts** has two controls, neither of which changes "
"`ALERT_RULES`. **Alert Notifications** snoozes every alert for up to 24 "
"hours (the admin API accepts up to seven days). **Alert Types** mutes one"
" type, such as `auth_ip_blocked`, for an hour, a day, a week or until "
"unmuted. Mutes are stored in the database and reach every process within "
"seconds. An incident that opens while muted or snoozed closes without a "
"recovery message; one posted before still gets its recovery."
msgstr ""
"**Admin → Settings → Alerts** 中有两个控件，都不会修改 `ALERT_RULES`。**Alert "
"Notifications** 可以把所有告警暂停最多 24 小时（管理 API 最多接受七天）。**Alert Types** "
"可以把某一类告警（例如 "
"`auth_ip_blocked`）静音一小时、一天、一周或直到取消静音。静音保存在数据库中，几秒内就会到达每个进程。在静音或暂停期间开始的事件结束时不会发送恢复消息；之前已发出的事件仍会收到恢复消息。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:493
msgid "Administrator activity"
msgstr "管理员活动"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:495
msgid ""
"Every hour the backend checks what administrators did since its last "
"report and sends up to two cards, each an alert type you can mute on its "
"own:"
msgstr "后端每小时检查一次管理员自上次报告以来的操作，最多发送两张卡片，每张都是一个可以单独静音的告警类型："

#: ../developer/deployment.md:498
msgid ""
"**Administrator access from a new address** (`admin_new_address`): an "
"administrator signed in, or failed to sign in, from an address the "
"account had not used in the previous 30 days; an administrator's session "
"acted from such an address; or the admin token acted from an address it "
"had not acted from. A session acting from an address the account has not "
"signed in from is marked as such, because a stolen session cookie looks "
"like that."
msgstr ""
"**Administrator access from a new "
"address**（`admin_new_address`）：管理员从该账户在之前 30 "
"天内没有用过的地址登录或登录失败；管理员的会话从这样的地址执行了操作；或者管理员令牌从它没有用过的地址执行了操作。会话从该账户没有登录过的地址执行操作时会被特别标注，因为会话"
" cookie 被盗用时就是这个样子。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:504
msgid ""
"**Dangerous administrator actions** (`admin_dangerous_action`): deleting "
"an account, removing an authenticator, creating a service account, "
"revealing an API key, exporting request logs or reading a batch's "
"prompts, downloading or restoring a configuration backup, adding, "
"removing or changing provider keys and definitions, muting or snoozing "
"alerts, purging sign-in records, lifting an auth-failure block, "
"restarting the backend, and giving an account the admin or internal role."
" Changing a setting that decides where alerts go, who may sign in or sign"
" up, or which client addresses the backend believes, or any secret "
"setting, counts too. Refused attempts are listed as well."
msgstr ""
"**Dangerous administrator "
"actions**（`admin_dangerous_action`）：删除账户、移除身份验证器、创建服务账户、显示 API "
"key、导出请求日志或读取批处理任务的提示词、下载或恢复配置备份、添加、移除或修改 provider key 和 provider "
"定义、将告警静音或暂停、清除登录记录、解除认证失败封禁、重启后端，以及授予账户 admin 或 internal "
"角色。修改决定告警发往何处、谁可以登录或注册、后端信任哪些客户端地址的设置项，或修改任何机密设置项，同样计入。被拒绝的尝试也会列出。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:514
msgid ""
"An address is an IPv4 address or an IPv6 /64. Each card lists up to 20 "
"findings (who, what, from which address and when) and counts the rest."
msgstr "地址指一个 IPv4 地址或一个 IPv6 /64。每张卡片最多列出 20 条发现（谁、做了什么、从哪个地址、何时），其余的只计数。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:517
msgid ""
"Each finding is reported once. When a card is delivered, the backend "
"writes an `admin_activity.alerted` row to the audit log saying how far it"
" covered, and the next check starts there, whichever replica runs it. A "
"card that is not delivered, because the channel refused it or alerts are "
"snoozed, goes out with the next check's findings, for up to seven days. A"
" muted type is recorded as handled without a card. The first check covers"
" the hour before it and records an `admin_activity.started` row."
msgstr ""
"每条发现只报告一次。卡片送达后，后端会在审计日志中写入一行 "
"`admin_activity.alerted`，记录它覆盖到的时间点，下一次检查就从那里开始，无论由哪个副本运行。因渠道拒收或告警被暂停而未送达的卡片，会随下一次检查的发现一起发出，最长可追溯七天。被静音的类型会被记录为已处理，但不发送卡片。第一次检查覆盖它之前的一小时，并写入一行"
" `admin_activity.started`。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:525
msgid ""
"The check reads nothing while no notification channel is set. It needs "
"the backend to know client addresses (see [Trusted Proxies and Client IPs"
"](trusted-proxies-and-client-ips.md)): a sign-in or action whose address "
"was not recorded is never new. In `ALERT_RULES`, `admin_activity.enabled:"
" false` turns it off and `admin_activity.lookback_days` (30 by default, 1"
" to 365) sets how long an address stays known; both apply after a "
"restart."
msgstr ""
"未设置通知渠道时，检查不读取任何数据。它需要后端知道客户端地址（见[可信代理与客户端 IP](trusted-proxies-and-"
"client-ips.md)）：没有记录地址的登录或操作永远不算新地址。在 `ALERT_RULES` "
"中，`admin_activity.enabled: false` 会关闭它，`admin_activity.lookback_days`（默认 "
"30，取值 1 到 365）设定一个地址保持为已知的时长；两者都在重启后生效。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:537
msgid "The first admin account"
msgstr "第一个管理员账号"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:539
msgid ""
"A new deployment creates its first administrator on the console's setup "
"page. Until then the backend refuses every sign-up, by email or phone:"
msgstr "新部署在控制台的设置页面上创建第一个管理员。在此之前，后端拒绝所有注册，无论通过邮箱还是手机号："

#: ../developer/deployment.md:542
msgid ""
"Read the setup code from the backend's log. It is stored in the database,"
" stays the same across restarts until setup is complete, and is logged at"
" every start whatever `LOG_LEVEL` is:"
msgstr "从后端日志中读取设置码。它保存在数据库中，在设置完成之前跨重启保持不变，并且无论 `LOG_LEVEL` 如何，每次启动都会打印："

#: ../developer/deployment.md:550
msgid "Open the console; while setup is pending every page sends you to `/setup`."
msgstr "打开控制台；设置未完成时，每个页面都会把你带到 `/setup`。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:551
msgid ""
"Enter the code and choose a username and password. This administrator has"
" no email address and signs in with the username. It can add one later in"
" **Account Settings → Email Address** once mail delivery works."
msgstr ""
"输入设置码，选择用户名和密码。这个管理员没有邮箱，用用户名登录。邮件发送可用后，它可以在 **Account Settings → Email "
"Address** 中添加邮箱。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:555
msgid ""
"Anyone who can read the backend log or the database can create this "
"account, so keep both private. Wrong codes are limited to ten per client "
"address in 15 minutes; the right code is never refused. Once an "
"administrator exists, you can close signup with the `signup_enabled` "
"runtime setting."
msgstr ""
"能读取后端日志或数据库的人就能创建这个账号，所以两者都要严格保密。错误的设置码每个客户端地址 15 "
"分钟内最多十次；正确的设置码永远不会被拒绝。管理员创建之后，可以用运行时设置 `signup_enabled` 关闭注册。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:560
msgid ""
"**Choose a username that is hard to guess.** Sign-in counts attempts "
"before it checks the password:"
msgstr "**选一个难以猜到的用户名。** 登录会在检查密码之前先计数："

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "Limit"
msgstr "限制"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "Default"
msgstr "默认值"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "Per username from one address"
msgstr "同一地址、同一用户名"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "5 in 15 minutes"
msgstr "所有地址、同一用户名"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "`LOGIN_RATE_LIMIT_PER_15MIN`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "Per username from all addresses"
msgstr "同一地址"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "50 in 15 minutes"
msgstr "15 分钟 5 次"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "`LOGIN_ACCOUNT_RATE_LIMIT_PER_15MIN`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "Per address"
msgstr "15 分钟 50 次"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "20 in an hour"
msgstr "1 小时 20 次"

#: ../developer/deployment.md
msgid "`LOGIN_RATE_LIMIT_PER_HOUR_PER_IP`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/deployment.md:569
msgid ""
"A browser that has signed in to the account before holds a device cookie "
"(`<REFRESH_TOKEN_COOKIE_NAME>_device`, valid 180 days) and gets five "
"attempts of its own per 15 minutes, so other people's guesses do not lock"
" it out. Changing `JWT_SECRET_KEY` invalidates device cookies. Other "
"browsers share the limits with their address, and behind the bundled "
"console every browser has the same address unless the gateway trusts your"
" edge's header (see [Behind the console](trusted-proxies-and-client-"
"ips.md#behind-the-console)). `admin` is the first name anyone tries."
msgstr ""
"曾经登录过该账号的浏览器持有一个设备 cookie（`<REFRESH_TOKEN_COOKIE_NAME>_device`，有效期 180 "
"天），每 15 分钟有自己的五次尝试，别人的猜测不会把它锁住。更改 `JWT_SECRET_KEY` 会让设备 cookie "
"失效。其他浏览器与同一地址共享限制，而在自带的控制台之后，除非网关信任你的边缘设置的请求头，所有浏览器的地址都相同（见[控制台之后"
"](trusted-proxies-and-client-ips.md#behind-the-console)）。`admin` "
"是任何人都会最先尝试的用户名。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:578
msgid ""
"The recovery tools below need no sign-in. `ADMIN_TOKEN`, when set, also "
"still reaches the admin API."
msgstr "下面的恢复工具都不需要登录。设置了 `ADMIN_TOKEN` 时，它也仍能访问管理 API。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:581
msgid "Creating an administrator without the browser"
msgstr "不用浏览器创建管理员"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:583
msgid ""
"`ops/admin/create_admin.py` creates an account with `role='admin'`, "
"`status='active'` and `email_verified=TRUE`, or promotes the existing "
"account with that address. Run it from the repository root, in the "
"project environment (`source .venv/bin/activate` after `make setup-dev`),"
" once the migrations have run:"
msgstr ""
"`ops/admin/create_admin.py` 创建一个 "
"`role='admin'`、`status='active'`、`email_verified=TRUE` "
"的账号，或者提升使用该邮箱的现有账号。在迁移执行之后，在仓库根目录、项目环境中（`make setup-dev` 之后执行 `source "
".venv/bin/activate`）运行它："

#: ../developer/deployment.md:593
msgid ""
"It reads the `DB_*` settings from `.env` and prompts for the password "
"when you omit `--password`. Any account created this way also completes "
"first-run setup."
msgstr "它从 `.env` 读取 `DB_*` 设置，省略 `--password` 时会提示输入密码。用这种方式创建任何账号也会完成首次运行设置。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:596
msgid "Resetting a forgotten password"
msgstr "重置忘记的密码"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:598
msgid ""
"The setup administrator has no email, so reset its password where the "
"backend runs:"
msgstr "首次设置创建的管理员没有邮箱，所以要在后端运行的地方重置它的密码："

#: ../developer/deployment.md:605
msgid ""
"It reads only the `DB_*` settings, asks for the new password twice (or "
"prints a strong one with `--generate`), and signs the account out "
"everywhere. It also accepts an email address. From a source checkout, run"
" `uv run python -m serving.auth.reset_password <username>` at the "
"repository root. It works on a database whose migrations are not yet "
"applied; name the account by email there."
msgstr ""
"它只读取 `DB_*` 设置，要求输入两次新密码（或用 `--generate` "
"打印一个强密码），并让该账号在所有地方退出登录。它也接受邮箱地址。在源码检出中，在仓库根目录运行 `uv run python -m "
"serving.auth.reset_password <username>`。它也能用于尚未执行迁移的数据库；这时请用邮箱指定账号。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:612
msgid "Undoing a setting that breaks sign-in"
msgstr "撤销导致无法登录的设置"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:614
msgid ""
"A setting that stops sign-in cannot be fixed in `.env` or from the "
"console. Reset it from the command line:"
msgstr "导致无法登录的设置项既不能在 `.env` 中修复，也不能在控制台中修复。请在命令行中重置："

#: ../developer/deployment.md:621
msgid ""
"`list`, `get KEY`, `set KEY VALUE` and `reset KEY` validate like Admin "
"and never print secrets; see [Without the console](configuration.md"
"#without-the-console). The backend picks the change up within about ten "
"seconds, or after a restart for a setting marked **Restart required**."
msgstr ""
"`list`、`get KEY`、`set KEY VALUE` 和 `reset KEY` 与 Admin "
"一样校验，并且从不打印密钥；见[不用控制台](configuration.md#without-the-"
"console)。后端大约十秒内会读到修改；标有 **Restart required** 的设置项则在重启后生效。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:626
msgid "Promoting accounts with `ADMIN_EMAILS`"
msgstr "用 `ADMIN_EMAILS` 提升账号"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:628
msgid ""
"`ADMIN_EMAILS` (under **Security** in **Admin → Settings → Sign-in & "
"security**) makes a listed address an administrator when that account "
"signs in. You do not need it for the first administrator."
msgstr ""
"`ADMIN_EMAILS`（位于 **Admin → Settings → Sign-in & security** 的 "
"**Security** 下）会在列出的邮箱对应的账号登录时把它设为管理员。创建第一个管理员不需要它。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:633
msgid ""
"Never combine open signup (`signup_enabled`), disabled email verification"
" (`signup_require_email_verification` off) and `ADMIN_EMAILS` on an "
"instance others can reach. Without verification, `POST /auth/signup` "
"marks any address verified, and the backend promotes a listed address to "
"`admin` on login and on every token refresh. Anyone who guesses an "
"`ADMIN_EMAILS` value becomes an administrator."
msgstr ""
"绝不要在别人能访问的实例上同时开启注册（`signup_enabled`）、关闭邮箱验证（`signup_require_email_verification`"
" 关闭）并使用 `ADMIN_EMAILS`。没有验证时，`POST /auth/signup` "
"会把任何地址标为已验证，而后端会在登录和每次刷新令牌时把列出的地址提升为 `admin`。猜到 `ADMIN_EMAILS` "
"中任一地址的人都会成为管理员。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:641
msgid ""
"Email verification is on by default and needs working mail: set "
"`SMTP_HOST`, `SMTP_USER` and `SMTP_PASSWORD` with `EMAIL_PROVIDER=smtp`, "
"or `CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID` and `CLOUDFLARE_EMAIL_API_TOKEN` with "
"`cloudflare`. There is no default mail service; see [Email and SMS "
"delivery providers](configuration.md#email-and-sms-delivery-providers). "
"`ADMIN_EMAILS` is also the default recipient list for signup approval "
"mail; `SIGNUP_NOTIFY_EMAILS` overrides it."
msgstr ""
"邮箱验证默认开启，需要可用的邮件服务：使用 `EMAIL_PROVIDER=smtp` 时设置 `SMTP_HOST`、`SMTP_USER` 和"
" `SMTP_PASSWORD`，使用 `cloudflare` 时设置 `CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID` 和 "
"`CLOUDFLARE_EMAIL_API_TOKEN`。没有默认的邮件服务；见[邮件与短信发送服务](configuration.md"
"#email-and-sms-delivery-providers)。`ADMIN_EMAILS` "
"也是注册审批邮件的默认收件人列表；`SIGNUP_NOTIFY_EMAILS` 可以覆盖它。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:649
msgid "Requiring two-factor authentication of administrators"
msgstr "要求管理员使用双重验证"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:651
msgid ""
"Any account can add an authenticator app (any TOTP app) in **Settings → "
"Two-Factor Authentication** and then confirms lasting changes, such as "
"raising a role, minting a key for another account or exporting secrets, "
"with a six-digit code. It gets ten recovery codes, shown once."
msgstr ""
"任何账号都可以在 **Settings → Two-Factor Authentication** 中添加身份验证器应用（任何 TOTP "
"应用），之后用六位数验证码确认持久性的修改，例如提升角色、为其他账号生成 key 或导出密钥。它会得到十个恢复码，只显示一次。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:656
msgid ""
"`ADMIN_TWO_FACTOR_REQUIRED=true` in `.env` makes an authenticator a "
"condition of administrator access. It is read from the environment only, "
"so an administrator session cannot switch it off. With it on:"
msgstr ""
"在 `.env` 中设置 `ADMIN_TWO_FACTOR_REQUIRED=true` "
"后，拥有身份验证器就成为获得管理员权限的前提。它只从环境变量读取，所以管理员会话无法把它关掉。开启后："

#: ../developer/deployment.md:660
msgid ""
"a console session reaches the Admin API only after giving a code, and "
"again when it appears in a different kind of client;"
msgstr "控制台会话只有在提供验证码后才能访问 Admin API，出现在另一种客户端中时还要再次提供；"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:662
msgid ""
"an administrator without an authenticator has no administrator access "
"until they add one, and only an account with one can be given the `admin`"
" role;"
msgstr "没有身份验证器的管理员在添加之前没有管理员权限，只有拥有身份验证器的账号才能被授予 `admin` 角色；"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:664
msgid "`ADMIN_TOKEN` is read-only, so move automation that writes with it first."
msgstr "`ADMIN_TOKEN` 变为只读，所以先迁移用它写入的自动化任务。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:666
msgid ""
"Enroll the administrators before you turn it on: until an account has an "
"authenticator, anyone with its password can add theirs. **Admin → Users**"
" shows whether an account has one and removes a lost one. "
"`TWO_FACTOR_STEP_UP_MINUTES` (default 10) is how long a code keeps "
"confirming changes."
msgstr ""
"先让管理员完成登记再开启：账号添加身份验证器之前，任何知道其密码的人都能添加自己的。**Admin → Users** "
"显示账号是否有身份验证器，并可以移除丢失的身份验证器。`TWO_FACTOR_STEP_UP_MINUTES`（默认 "
"10）是验证码可以持续确认修改的时长。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:673
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"An administrator who loses both the device and the recovery codes cannot "
"reach the Admin API. Another administrator removes the authenticator in "
"**Admin → Users** (`POST /admin/users/{user_id}/two-factor/reset`). If "
"there is no other administrator, delete it in the database and add a new "
"one with the account's password:"
msgstr ""
"同时丢失设备和恢复码的管理员无法访问 Admin API。另一位管理员可以在 **Admin → Users** 中移除其身份验证器（`POST "
"/admin/users/{user_id}/two-"
"factor/reset`）。如果没有其他管理员，就在数据库中删除它，再用该账号的密码添加新的："

#: ../developer/deployment.md:682
msgid "Database"
msgstr "数据库"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:684
msgid ""
"PostgreSQL runs in the `postgres` service with its data in the volume "
"`hybridinference_postgres_data`. The schema, backups, pgAdmin and what "
"the database holds are in [Database](database.md)."
msgstr ""
"PostgreSQL 运行在 `postgres` 服务中，数据保存在卷 `hybridinference_postgres_data` "
"里。schema、备份、pgAdmin 以及数据库中存放的内容见[数据库](database.md)。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:688
msgid "Applying schema migrations"
msgstr "执行表结构迁移"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:690
msgid ""
"Run the migrations with the image you are about to start, while the old "
"one still serves, and start the new one only when they succeed:"
msgstr "在旧版本仍在服务时，用即将启动的镜像执行迁移，迁移成功后再启动新版本："

#: ../developer/deployment.md:672
msgid "Deployment"
msgstr "部署方式"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:672
msgid "The step"
msgstr "这一步怎么做"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:672
msgid "The bundled Compose stack"
msgstr "自带的 Compose 栈"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:672
msgid "`make migrate`; `make up` and `make build` run it for you"
msgstr "`make migrate`；`make up` 和 `make build` 会替你执行"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:672
msgid "Pinned images (`make deploy`)"
msgstr "固定镜像（`make deploy`）"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:672
msgid ""
"`make deploy` runs it before switching over; `make rollback` never runs "
"an older image's migrations"
msgstr "`make deploy` 会在切换之前执行这一步；`make rollback` 从不执行旧镜像的迁移"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:672
msgid "A systemd unit (`deploy/systemd/`)"
msgstr "systemd 服务单元（`deploy/systemd/`）"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:672
msgid ""
"`.venv/bin/python -m migrations upgrade` in the unit's working directory,"
" with its environment, before `systemctl restart`"
msgstr ""
"在 `systemctl restart` 之前，在单元的工作目录里、用它的环境执行 `.venv/bin/python -m "
"migrations upgrade`"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:699
msgid "Rules for your own deploy script:"
msgstr "自己编写部署脚本时的规则："

#: ../developer/deployment.md:701
msgid ""
"Migrate with the same image, by digest, that you start. Images with "
"versioned migrations carry the label "
"`org.hybridinference.schema.migrations=alembic`."
msgstr ""
"用将要启动的同一个镜像（按摘要）执行迁移。带版本化迁移的镜像有 "
"`org.hybridinference.schema.migrations=alembic` 标签。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:703
msgid ""
"Use a one-off container with `--no-deps`, and check yourself that the "
"database is up; otherwise Compose may recreate the database first. If the"
" backend service pins an `ipv4_address`, give the migrations their own "
"service (same image and `DB_*` settings, the database's network only, a "
"profile so `up` never starts it), or Docker refuses with `Address already"
" in use`."
msgstr ""
"使用带 `--no-deps` 的一次性容器，并自行确认数据库已启动；否则 Compose 可能会先重建数据库。如果后端服务固定了 "
"`ipv4_address`，请给迁移单独定义一个服务（相同镜像和 `DB_*` 设置，只接入数据库所在网络，并放在一个 profile 中，让 "
"`up` 永远不会启动它），否则 Docker 会以 `Address already in use` 拒绝。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:708
msgid ""
"If the script arrives on stdin (`ssh host bash -s`), run the one-off with"
" `</dev/null`; `compose run` reads stdin even with `-T` and swallows the "
"rest of the script."
msgstr ""
"如果脚本是通过 stdin 传入的（`ssh host bash -s`），运行一次性容器时加上 `</dev/null`；`compose "
"run` 即使加了 `-T` 也会读取 stdin，吞掉脚本的剩余部分。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:711
msgid ""
"Do not run migrations on every start (a `service_completed_successfully` "
"dependency, an init container): every restart would wait on table locks."
msgstr "不要在每次启动时都运行迁移（`service_completed_successfully` 依赖、init 容器）：每次重启都会等待表锁。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:713
msgid ""
"If the step fails, stop. Exit status 75 means a lock was not available in"
" time; run it again later."
msgstr "这一步失败时就停下来。退出码 75 表示没能及时拿到锁；稍后再运行一次。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:716
msgid ""
"The backend refuses to start on an unmigrated database, so a missed step "
"shows up as a failed start. Have the step working before the first image "
"with the label arrives."
msgstr "后端拒绝在未迁移的数据库上启动，所以漏掉这一步会表现为启动失败。在第一个带该标签的镜像到来之前，让这一步先跑通。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:720
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排查"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:722
msgid "A service will not start"
msgstr "某个服务起不来"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:672
msgid "Message"
msgstr "消息"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:672
msgid "Fix"
msgstr "解决办法"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:672
msgid ""
"`required variable DB_NAME is missing a value: DB_NAME must be set in "
".env file`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/deployment.md:672
msgid ""
"Compose stopped before starting anything. Set `DB_NAME`, `DB_USER` and "
"`DB_PASSWORD` in `.env`"
msgstr "Compose 在启动任何服务之前就停止了。在 `.env` 中设置 `DB_NAME`、`DB_USER` 和 `DB_PASSWORD`"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:672
msgid "Port already in use"
msgstr "端口已被占用"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:672
msgid "Override `BACKEND_PORT`, `FRONTEND_PORT` or `DB_PORT` in `.env`"
msgstr "在 `.env` 中改用其他 `BACKEND_PORT`、`FRONTEND_PORT` 或 `DB_PORT`"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:672
msgid "Database connection failed"
msgstr "数据库连接失败"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:672
msgid "Check the `postgres` health in `make ps`"
msgstr "在 `make ps` 中检查 `postgres` 的健康状态"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:672
msgid ""
"`The database records no schema version` or `The database is at revision "
"…, behind this code's …`"
msgstr ""
"`The database records no schema version` 或 `The database is at revision "
"…, behind this code's …`"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:672
msgid ""
"Run `make migrate` (or [your deployment's step](#applying-schema-"
"migrations)), then start the backend"
msgstr "运行 `make migrate`（或[你的部署方式对应的步骤](#applying-schema-migrations)），然后启动后端"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:672
msgid ""
"`Configuration load failed after 3 attempts`, then `Authentication "
"configuration incomplete`"
msgstr ""
"`Configuration load failed after 3 attempts`，之后是 `Authentication "
"configuration incomplete`"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:672
msgid ""
"The backend could not read its settings from the database. Fix the "
"connection; do not add secrets to `.env`"
msgstr "后端无法从数据库读取设置项。修好数据库连接；不要把密钥写进 `.env`"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:672
msgid "The console shows a configuration error with a retry button"
msgstr "控制台显示带重试按钮的配置错误"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:672
msgid ""
"The console could not get a valid `/site-config` from the backend within "
"three seconds. Check the frontend logs and the backend, then retry"
msgstr "控制台没能在三秒内从后端拿到有效的 `/site-config`。检查前端日志和后端，然后重试"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:738
msgid "The backend's memory after large requests"
msgstr "大请求过后后端的内存"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:740
msgid ""
"At startup the backend fixes glibc's mmap threshold at 128 KiB, glibc's "
"own starting value, and logs `Allocator: glibc mmap threshold fixed at "
"128 KiB`. Without this, the threshold rises with every large request body"
" or reply the backend frees, and the process keeps a burst's memory long "
"after the burst ends. `serving/servers/allocator.py` has the details. An "
"operator's own `MALLOC_MMAP_THRESHOLD_`, or `glibc.malloc.mmap_threshold`"
" in `GLIBC_TUNABLES`, takes precedence. With any other C library the "
"backend changes nothing."
msgstr ""
"后端启动时会把 glibc 的 mmap 阈值固定在 128 KiB，也就是 glibc 自己的初始值，并记录日志 `Allocator: "
"glibc mmap threshold fixed at 128 "
"KiB`。不这样做的话，后端每释放一个大的请求体或回复，阈值就会随之升高，一阵大请求过去很久之后，进程仍占着那批内存。细节见 "
"`serving/servers/allocator.py`。运维人员自己设置的 `MALLOC_MMAP_THRESHOLD_`，或 "
"`GLIBC_TUNABLES` 中的 `glibc.malloc.mmap_threshold`，优先生效。换成其他 C "
"库时，后端不做任何改动。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:748
msgid "A monitor or service account is suddenly getting 429s"
msgstr "监控或服务账号突然开始收到 429"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:750
msgid ""
"`Too many authentication failures from this IP. Temporarily blocked.` is "
"the gateway's own abuse defense. A source with "
"`AUTH_FAILURE_BLOCK_THRESHOLD` failed authentications within "
"`AUTH_FAILURE_BLOCK_WINDOW_SEC` (200 in a day by default) is refused for "
"`AUTH_FAILURE_BLOCK_DURATION_SEC` (a day)."
msgstr ""
"`Too many authentication failures from this IP. Temporarily blocked.` "
"是网关自己的防滥用机制。在 `AUTH_FAILURE_BLOCK_WINDOW_SEC` 内认证失败达到 "
"`AUTH_FAILURE_BLOCK_THRESHOLD` 次（默认一天 200 次）的来源会被拒绝 "
"`AUTH_FAILURE_BLOCK_DURATION_SEC`（一天）。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:755
msgid ""
"It usually hits a caller you own whose key was rotated or revoked. The "
"block is checked before the key, so fixing the credential does not lift "
"it, and the 429 hides whether the original 401 or 403 is fixed. To find "
"the caller, turn on the `log_rejected_requests` runtime setting: refusals"
" appear in **Recent Requests** as `ip_blocked` rows naming the account "
"behind the key, with its state (`revoked`, `expired`, `user_suspended`). "
"A row without a user is unresolved, not proof of a stranger."
msgstr ""
"它通常落在你自己的、key 被轮换或吊销的调用方身上。封禁检查在 key 检查之前，所以修好凭据并不能解除封禁，而 429 也掩盖了原来的 401"
" 或 403 是否已经解决。要找出调用方，开启运行时设置 `log_rejected_requests`：被拒绝的请求会以 "
"`ip_blocked` 行出现在 **Recent Requests** 中，写明 key "
"背后的账号及其状态（`revoked`、`expired`、`user_suspended`）。没有用户的行表示未能解析，并不能证明是陌生人。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:763
msgid "Fix the credential, then clear the block:"
msgstr "修好凭据，然后解除封禁："

#: ../developer/deployment.md:778
msgid ""
"`cleared: false` means nothing was blocked. To exempt a source "
"permanently, list it in `AUTH_FAILURE_BLOCK_EXEMPT_IPS` (comma-separated "
"addresses or CIDRs). The blocklist lives in each process's memory: a "
"restart clears it, and with several workers each keeps its own."
msgstr ""
"`cleared: false` 表示原本就没有封禁。要永久豁免某个来源，把它加入 "
"`AUTH_FAILURE_BLOCK_EXEMPT_IPS`（逗号分隔的地址或 CIDR）。封禁列表保存在每个进程的内存中：重启会清空它，多个 "
"worker 各自维护一份。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:783
msgid "Resetting the stack"
msgstr "重置这套服务栈"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:785
msgid ""
"`make down && make up` keeps the data. To start with an empty database, "
"remove the volume by name. `docker compose down -v` does not remove it, "
"because it is declared `external: true`, and `make up` would come back on"
" the same data:"
msgstr ""
"`make down && make up` 会保留数据。要从空数据库开始，请按名称删除卷。`docker compose down -v` "
"不会删除它，因为它被声明为 `external: true`，`make up` 会带着同样的数据回来："

#: ../developer/deployment.md:795
msgid ""
"The backend then starts as a new deployment: new secrets unless `.env` "
"supplies them, the settings `.env` still holds imported, and a new setup "
"code."
msgstr "随后后端会像新部署一样启动：除非 `.env` 提供，否则生成新的密钥，导入 `.env` 中仍有的设置项，并打印新的设置码。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:799
msgid ""
"`docker volume rm` is irreversible and takes every account, API key, "
"request log and stored setting with it. Take a `pg_dump` first if any of "
"it matters."
msgstr ""
"`docker volume rm` 不可逆，所有账号、API key、请求日志和已存储的设置项都会随之删除。只要其中有任何数据还有用，先做一次 "
"`pg_dump`。"

#: ../developer/deployment.md:803
msgid ""
"pgAdmin's volume is separate; see [Resetting pgAdmin](database.md"
"#resetting-pgadmin)."
msgstr "pgAdmin 的卷是单独的；见[重置 pgAdmin](database.md#resetting-pgadmin)。"
